    "summary": "Cloth/ circumcision equipment composed of eight hand plain woven narrow strips hand sewn together selvedge to selvedge. The cloth has been decorated using the mud resist method. The pattern can be divided into five sections:\r\n1.The pattern is divided into 16 repeating blocks consisting of zig-zags and crosses]\r\n2.The pattern is divided into 81repeating blocks consisting of a central circle four zig-zags and a series of small triangles\r\n3.Repeating square pattern\r\n4.Zig-zags and diamonds\r\n5.The pattern is divided into 52 similar blocks decorated with pairs of zig-zags\r\nThe cloth is unhemmed.",
